Foral, called Lieutenant Foral, is a goblin of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]], small and green-skinned, dressed in layers of tight black leather and cloaks. He carries a rifle taller than he is, an electronic scanner, and cartridges for every purpose. He works alone when he can, from hiding, and picks his shots. His wife was murdered and the death was ruled an accident, and he means to find whoever did it. He has a daughter, Lily, who is sick, and he carries her cure with him.
